    <h1>Open Source Licenses</h1>

    <p>Linxira OS is built directly on Arch Linux and incorporates multiple upstream open source projects. Linxira OS is an independent project and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Arch Linux.</p>

    <h2>Linxira OS Own Licenses</h2>
