      <h3>Code & Configuration</h3>
      <p>Custom code, configuration files, and build scripts are licensed under <strong>GPL-3.0</strong>.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="license-box">
      <h3>Documentation & Website</h3>
      <p>Documentation, Wiki, and website content are licensed under <strong>CC BY-SA 4.0</strong>.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="license-box">
      <h3>Brand Assets</h3>
      <p>Logos, wallpapers, icons, and other brand assets are reserved Linxira property and are not offered under a general public license. See the <a href="/en/docs/brand-assets/" style="color:#20B8B0;">Brand Assets Policy</a>.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Upstream Licenses</h2>
    <p>Each upstream component remains governed by its own license. Distribution together in Linxira OS does not place the entire operating-system aggregation under one license. Key upstream components include:</p>

